@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title E37: 계획 시각 이후 경과 분 (계획 = 만조 - 30분, 4분 늦게 admission)

concise "admission" as S
concise "pump (출력 의도)" as P

@0
S is "열림: [계획, 계획+10분)"
P is "false"

@4
P is "admission부터 5분 운전"

@9
P is "false"

@10
S is "닫힘 (끝 제외)"

S@0 <-> @10 : within(10min)
P@4 <-> @9 : run(5min)
@enduml
